\Level{Diploma}
\Question{What causes hardness in water?}
\Explain{Presence of Ca^{2+} and Mg^{2+} salts.}
\Answer{Ca^{2+}, Mg^{2+}}
\Formula{Hardness often expressed as mg CaCO_{3}/L.}

