\Explain{At constant temperature $V\propto I$. Plot of $V$ vs $I$ is straight line; slope = $R$.}
\Answer{$V=IR$}
\Formula{Ohm’s law.}

\item
\Topic{Resistors in Parallel}
\From{Basic Electrical Engineering, Unit: Circuits}
\Level{Diploma}
\Question{Find equivalent resistance for $R_1$ and $R_2$ in parallel.}
